# Store and check out every text file with LF, on every platform.
#
# Without this, Git on Windows hands out CRLF working copies while storing LF, so a
# clone on macOS or Linux reports all 61 files as modified before anyone has touched
# them. Pinning it here makes the line ending a property of the repository rather than
# of whoever cloned it.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Images and fonts must never be line-ending converted; a substituted byte corrupts
# them silently. Nothing binary is tracked yet, but a favicon or a font would be.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.woff2 binary
